<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Fe Int'l started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Santa Fe International Corp as strong buy.</p>
